  "markdown": "# How LangGraph Relates to LangChain\n\n## Summary\n\nLangGraph was created by LangChain. [S2] LangGraph is built on LangChain. [S2] LangGraph supports cyclic graph capabilities with centralized state management. [S4]\n\n## How the frameworks are used\n\nLangChain helps teams move quickly in the early stages. [S4]\n\n## Limitations\n\n- The evidence does not establish a detailed security or privacy comparison between LangGraph and LangChain.\n- The evidence does not establish a quantified comparison of their costs or performance.\n- 3 extracted finding(s) were excluded because their quotes could not be located in the source text\n- 1 generated claim(s) were excluded because the cited evidence did not support them, or because verification did not reach them within this run's budget.\n\n## Sources\n\n- **[S1]** [LangGraph Alternatives: Graph Control vs Managed Runtime in 2026 | Logic](https://logic.inc/resources/langgraph-alternatives) \u2014 logic.inc, other, n.d., quality 0.58 _(retrieved, not cited \u2014 4 citable quotes extracted)_\n- **[S2]** [What is LangGraph? | IBM](https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/langgraph) \u2014 ibm.com, other, n.d., quality 0.61\n- **[S3]** [LangChain and LangGraph: Critical Vulnerabilities in AI Orchestration \u2013 Lab Space](https://labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org/research/csa-research-note-langchain-langgraph-vulnerabilities-202603) \u2014 labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org, other, n.d., quality 0.60 _(retrieved, not cited \u2014 5 citable quotes extracted)_\n- **[S4]** [LangChain vs LangGraph: Performance, Cost & ROI (2026 Guide)](https://www.alphabold.com/langchain-vs-langgraph) \u2014 alphabold.com, other, n.d., quality 0.61\n- **[S5]** [10 Langgraph Projects to Build Intelligent AI Agents](https://www.projectpro.io/article/langgraph-projects-and-examples/1124) \u2014 projectpro.io, other, n.d., quality 0.61 _(retrieved, not cited \u2014 3 citable quotes extracted)_\n\n## Citation verification\n\n- Evidence references: 4